<title>USA: First of America says sets 3-for-2 split.</title>
<headline>First of America says sets 3-for-2 split.</headline>
<dateline>KALAMAZOO, Mich. 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>First of America Bank Corp said its board declared a three-for-two stock split in the form of a 50-percent stock dividend payable May 30 to shareholders of record May 9.</p>
<p>The bank holding company has 59.7 million shares outstanding. After the split, there will be 89.6 million shares outstanding, First of America said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
